        <mxCell id="c48" parent="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;" value="Parallel, as built. The two tanks run side by side and are summed.&#xa;The knob is &quot;Short / Long Tank Mix&quot;, a crossfade that always sums to 100%.&#xa;Hard left = 100% Short, noon = 50 / 50, hard right = 100% Long.&#xa;No +6 dB makeup here, unlike Series.&#xa;NOTE: the long branch taps the wet input BEFORE the wet predelay and uses only its&#xa;own 30 to 42 ms predelay, so the two tanks are not fed the same timing." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="120" width="1100" x="60" y="680" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
